+# TLS Certificate Verification (Development Builds)
+
+This project has no current recorded decision on TLS certificate verification in development builds. A prior decision record on this topic (`config/decisions/revoke-tls-verification.json`) was removed from the repository in commit `4c58474` ("move decision config out of the tree"), and no replacement decision has been recorded since; until a new decision is recorded, no project-sanctioned position on this topic should be assumed.
